{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20266GkUBMstHw1794960628.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國蘋果公司旗下多個服務平台一度出現故障，蘋果指，不涉及黑客網絡攻擊。</p><p></p><p>蘋果公司證實周二出現系統故障，受影響包括雲端平台iCloud、下載軟件網站App Store、音樂平台Apple Music，以及在裝置上購買產品保險服務的AppleCare等，導致用戶無法登入。蘋果公司解釋，內部更新導致部分服務中斷，之後多個系統陸續恢復運作。</p><p></p><p>美國多家大型金融機構的網上服務當地周一曾出現技術故障，微軟365平台，包括電郵及會議服務，上周亦出現大規模中斷。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T01:03:01.198335+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":224,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T00:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T22:37:33.005271+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T00:56:24.579117+00:00","content_hash":"51830f16633f23d8aef5a015870a8ae5cf44c285b2ee93b8cae8afeee3c57509","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T01:03:01.198335+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}